sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant CS as Content script
  participant SW as Service worker
  participant BE as FastAPI backend
  participant NV as Nova Lite
  U->>CS: release backtick after speaking
  CS->>SW: shortcut-release
  SW->>SW: stop recorder and wait for audio blob
  SW->>SW: capture screenshot
  SW->>BE: WS transcribe stream with audio
  BE-->>SW: transcript text
  SW->>CS: scrape-dom
  CS-->>SW: DOM snapshot with selectors
  SW->>BE: POST task with command, PNG screenshot, DOM
  BE->>NV: converse with system prompt
  NV-->>BE: one action as JSON
  BE-->>SW: steps with first action
  loop until done or 25 iterations
    SW->>CS: execute-action
    CS-->>SW: ok summary or FAILED error
    SW->>CS: wait-for-dom-stable then scrape-dom
    CS-->>SW: fresh snapshot
    SW->>BE: POST task continue with history
    BE->>NV: converse with continue prompt
    NV-->>BE: next action or done
    BE-->>SW: steps or done
  end
  SW->>CS: bubble-done-summary and tts All done
